{
  "about": "Mobster's generated plates: the glaze and glass photographs every cover and card ground is made from (docs/brand/art/README.md, Plates). Each plate's master and the exact prompt that made it live in the brand team's folder (~/mobster-work), at `master` and `prompt`; `native` is the image tool's own size, which the 3840 x 2160 master enlarges once with Lanczos. A plate joins only after it passes review at 100% and 400% (no mush, seams or marks) and the neutral rule. `tone` (saturation, dim) quiets a plate whose colour is too loud beside Night and violet. `family` is the plate's shape (wet pools, panes, slabs, block edges and so on): two neighbours in an index never share one. site/content/covers.json names a plate by its id.",
